# vision-engine (FastAPI) structure

```text
services/vision-engine/
├── app/
│   ├── main.py              # FastAPI app, lifespan, health
│   ├── api/                 # routers only (thin)
│   ├── schemas/             # Pydantic request/response models
│   ├── services/            # detection, embedding, matching
│   ├── core/                # settings, logging
│   └── workers/             # optional CPU pool helpers
├── tests/
├── requirements.txt         # or pyproject + lock
└── Dockerfile
```

- Routers call services; no OpenCV/DeepFace calls inside route functions beyond delegating.
- Settings via env / pydantic-settings; never commit model API keys or raw biometric samples.
- Health: `/health` (liveness) and readiness that fails if model weights failed to load.
- Return worker match metadata and scores; do not log full embedding vectors.
